    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "M\nE\nI/UnITED AIRLInES",
      "W\nN\nE\nWe are pleased to present an array of fine California wines\ncarefully selected for their excellence by United's Cellar Committee\nunder the guidance of wine judge and author; Bob Thompson.\nYour Flight Attendant will inform you which wines are being offered.\nCHAMPAGNE\nDomaine Chandon Napa Valley Brut NV\nCHARDONNAY\nWilliam Wheeler\nVilla Mt. Eden\nSonoma County 1989\nor Napa Valley 1989\nCABERNET SAUVIGNON\nChâteau Souverain 1988\nor Louis Martini Reserve 1987\nMAI TAI\nblends a variety of Fruit Juices with Rum\nin a refreshing tropical Cocktail Drink\nEnjoy a Snack\nwith your preferred Cocktail or Beverage\n16121\n2\nN\nA Chilled Deli Sampler\nthat features sliced Roast Sirloin, Ham, Smoked Turkey\nand Shrimp served with Cocktail Sauce\naccompanied by Rice Salad with Vegetables\nand fresh Papaya, Grapes and Strawberries\n• •\nA Light Palate Pleaser\nconsisting of Danish Blue, Double Gloucester and Chaumes Cheese\noffered with fresh Melon, Strawberries, and Pineapple\nN\nD\nFTER\nTreat Yourself\nto today's bakery selection\nThe Finishing Touch\nwe recommend is 100% Colombian Coffee,\nCappuccino or selected Herbal Teas\n1612-1\nS33E\n11/92"
    ],
